[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12962.55, "timestamp": "03:36:02", "text": "これらには時間がかかるだろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12971.91, "timestamp": "03:36:11", "text": "これは何と呼ぶのですか？アッカ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12973.429, "timestamp": "03:36:13", "text": "ハニー。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12975.91, "timestamp": "03:36:15", "text": "この種の動物を何と呼びますか？ A"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12978.79, "timestamp": "03:36:18", "text": "唾を吐いたりするペッカ。そうそう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12982.309, "timestamp": "03:36:22", "text": "神。そうそう。それは神だ。うん。一度もない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12983.83, "timestamp": "03:36:23", "text": "心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12987.269, "timestamp": "03:36:27", "text": "待って。神にはそういう角が2本ある。おお。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12991.83, "timestamp": "03:36:31", "text": "そして、ひげ。知りませんでした。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13005.67, "timestamp": "03:36:45", "text": "K-POPが死んだかのように思われた後、彼らは成功した。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13017.19, "timestamp": "03:36:57", "text": "投げたのは、戻ってくるから。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13019.83, "timestamp": "03:36:59", "text": "忠誠心。うん。神様、それは"}]